{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>From all your gifts you shall set apart the entire terumah of YHWH.</b> The verse speaks of the great terumah — for if the Levite preceded the priest at the heap and received his tithes before the priest took the great terumah from the heap, the Levite must first separate from the tithe one part in fifty for the great terumah, and then go back and separate terumat ma'aser (Sifrei)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:11:33.505044345Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}